[length:05:33]
[ti:Restless]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Chaotic - Dysfunctional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:02.81]In my restless dreams
[00:07.61]I see that town
[00:10.34]Silent Hill
[00:12.58]You promised you'd take me
[00:16.05]There again someday
[00:18.71]But you never did
[00:31.57]Well I'm alone there now
[00:33.97]In our special place
[00:36.22]Waiting for you
[00:38.52]Waiting for you to
[00:40.82]Come to see me
[00:45.67]But you never do
[00:52.02]And so I wait, wrapped in my
[00:55.07]Cocoon of pain and loneliness
[00:57.32]I know I've done a terrible
[00:59.63]Thing to you
[01:01.51]Something you'll
[01:04.41]Never forgive me for
[01:08.01]I wish I could change
[01:09.71]that, but I can't
[01:12.46]I feel so pathetic and ugly
[01:16.73]Laying here, 
[01:20.87]waiting for you
[01:28.93]Every day I stare up at the cracks
[01:31.38]In the ceiling
[01:33.42]And all I can think
[01:37.00]About is how unfair it all is
[01:54.06]The doctor came today
[01:56.03]He told me I could go
[01:57.79]Home for a short stay
[02:01.89]It's not that I'm getting better
[02:04.39]It's just that this may be
[02:07.43]My last chance
[02:09.53]I think you know what I mean
[02:14.23]Even so, I'm glad to be coming
[02:16.16]Home
[02:16.89]I've missed you terribly
[02:17.96]But I'm afraid
[02:19.34]I'm afraid you don't really
[02:20.56]Want me to come home
[02:23.72]Whenever you come see me
[02:26.14]I can tell how hard it is on you
[02:32.22]I don't know if you
[02:33.76]Hate me or pity me
[02:35.62]Or maybe I just disgust you
[02:41.04]I'm sorry about that
[02:43.04]When I first learned that
[02:44.48]I was going to die
[02:45.64]I just
[02:46.51]Didn't want to accept it
[02:48.12]I was so angry all the time
[02:53.00]And I struck out
[02:53.94]At everyone I loved most
[02:55.46]Especially you, James
[02:57.50]That's why I understand
[02:59.62]If you do hate me
[03:03.98]But I want you to
[03:05.15]Know this
[03:07.40]I’ll always love you
[03:11.88]I’ll always love you
[03:16.89]I can’t tell you to remember me
[03:19.21]But I can’t bear for you to forget me
[03:27.58]I’ll always love you
[03:30.49]Even after I’m gone
[03:35.04]You made me happy
[03:37.38]Happy
[03:38.67]Happy
[03:39.63]Happy
[03:48.21]Even though our life together had
[03:49.21]To end like this
[03:51.56]I still wouldn't
[03:53.48]Trade it for the world
[03:56.74]We had
[03:58.40]Some wonderful years together
[04:02.60]Well, this letter had gone on
[04:05.27]Too long
[04:06.84]So I'll say goodbye
[04:08.91]I told the nurse to give
[04:10.63]this to you after I'm gone
[04:13.12]That means that as you read
[04:15.84]this
[04:16.58]I'm already dead
[04:23.85]I can't tell you to remember me
[04:28.35]But I can't bear for you to
[04:32.96]Forget me
[04:38.29]These last few years since I
[04:40.14]Became ill
[04:41.09]I'm so sorry for
[04:42.10]What I did to you
[04:43.96]Did to us
[04:46.63]You've given me so much
[04:48.56]And I haven't been able to return
[04:50.87]A single thing
[04:54.18]That's why I want you to live
[04:56.45]For yourself now
[05:00.31]Do what's best for you
[05:02.91]I’ll always love you
[05:08.03]I’ll always love you
[05:13.18]I can’t tell you to remember me
[05:26.17]I can’t tell you to
[05:29.44]remember me
